 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Read reviews from people who eat there and trust their taste in food. Also, if it' busy, it's probably good. Photos are useful but they can mislead. A bright room with good lighting says nothing about the food. It means they want to make you happy without wasting food. A long menu means you have choices, but you also have to read through them all. You've already done more than enough. Just remember to check the reviews and see if it' busy. That's the gold standard.",
